name: sim.readCollision
description:
luaSynopsis: int collisionState, int[2] collidingObjectHandles=sim.readCollision(int collisionObjectHandle)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. collisionObjectHandle: handle of the collision object
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. collisionState: collision state (0 or 1)
2. collidingObjectHandles: handles of the two colliding objects.
replacedBy:
- name: checkCollision, class: sceneObject, file: sceneObject_checkCollision.method
